## Context

The resident-rules channel (rules/*.md auto-loaded per session) was
exactly at its 17800-char ceiling. The 256K monster guard the author
asked to engrave (session 2026-10-06, ticket 1024) — even condensed to
five lines, with its decomposition mechanics delegated to workflow.md's
existing monster-ticket doctrine — costs 296 chars. The roar bundle
(#1237) is red on exactly this: test_resident_rules_stay_within_budget,
total 18096 > 17800.

The guard's message is the house rule: raising a budget is a ticket,
not an edit. This is the ticket.

## Options for the author

